0 !BRICK_STATE {"schema_version":3,"status":"instruction_reconstruction_in_progress","version_label":"버전 0","reference_set":"LEGO Harry Potter Hogwarts Castle (71043)","source_manual_segments":["6590084-80.pdf","6590084-145.pdf","6607899-54.pdf","6607899-95.pdf","6607899-150.pdf","6607899-194.pdf","6607900-70.pdf","6607900-125.pdf","6607900-165.pdf","6607900-182.pdf","6607901-50.pdf","6607901-106.pdf"],"coverage":"6607901-50.pdf, booklet 22, printed pp.10–18 (steps 1–18) inspected as images. Root submodel hogwarts-frame.ldr has steps1–7. Local unplaced definitions: step8 partial with a 64179 ring, two 2420 corner plates, one 32278 rail and two 2780 pins; step14–15 with 32524/four pins/64179/32278; step17 with 64179/four pins. Steps9–13 and16 have not been reconstructed; step18 has a tentative independent beam-and-pin module. Circular builds on printed pp.6–9 remain separate.","piece_count":25,"placement_status":"Step8 local rail/frame contact pair at z=±60 has coincident centers/axes; its 3 callout gray connector blocks and lime center plate remain omitted pending shape/placement evidence. Step14–15, step17 are local definitions and not root reachable. Steps9–13 and16 still require additions; step18 is a tentative local module only.","validation":{"part_files":"shared LDraw shapes referenced","physical_fit":"Step1 four pins to root 64179 frame: center/axis residual 0 LDU; adjacent beam/frame layers traverse 20 LDU each. Step8 local rail 32278 and frame 64179 have two matching side-hole centers/axes at [50,0,±60]; 2780 pins run along +X through both. Contact fit/tolerance is not physically tested. part-0006 root rail end and part-0012/tan supports remain provisional as described in their notes.","full_manual_coverage":"in_progress","geometry_checks":"instance IDs, transforms, quantities checked locally; full validator requires catalog offer metadata not verified"},"steps":[{"pages":"10–12","steps":[1,7],"evidence":"Booklet 22 printed pp.10–12; existing root placements include the 64179 frame and step6–7 candidate pieces. See per-instance placement notes; several contacts remain provisional.","placement":"Root file hogwarts-frame.ldr; placed count 25."},{"pages":"13","steps":[8],"evidence":"Printed p.13 step8 parts and sequence: 64179 open-center 5x7 frame, 32278 long Technic rail, two 2780 pins, two purple 2420 corner plates, one lime 2x2 axle-hole plate, one gray 1x2 connector and two gray 2x2 side-pin connectors. Step1 inserts pins into the rail; step2 joins the frame; step3 turns the ring subassembly.","placement":"Local hogwarts-step8.ldr includes frame 64179, opposite-corner 2420 plates, 32278 rail and pins at z=−60,+60. The two pin axes/centers match both the frame and rail holes. Gray connector blocks and center plate are not yet placed; full step8 is partial and not root reachable."},{"pages":"17","steps":[14,15],"evidence":"Printed p.17 step14 makes a yellow 32524 beam with four 2780 pins; step15 adds a 64179 frame and 32278 long rail.","placement":"Local hogwarts-step14.ldr; seven physical references. Four frame/pin contacts align. Global placement is deferred pending confirmed relation to the root structure."},{"pages":"18","steps":[17],"evidence":"Printed p.18 step17 shows a 64179 frame with four 2780 pins.","placement":"Local hogwarts-step17.ldr; four pin axes align with the frame side holes. Global placement awaits a confirmed step16 joint."},{"pages":"18","steps":[18],"evidence":"Printed p.18 step18 callout shows one 90-degree gray L-shaped Technic beam and two pins. 32140 matches the visible 90-degree shape and candidate hole count, but no element number is printed.","placement":"Tentative local submodel hogwarts-step18.ldr: 32140 with 2780 pins in candidate holes (0,0,20) and (20,0,60). Axes/centers match the candidate DAT; part identity and selected holes remain uncertain. Not root reachable."}],"instances":[{"id":"part-0001","group":"frame","part":"32524.dat","gobricks_id":"","sku":"","color":14,"position":[0